<p><hr align=left size=1 noshade width="100%"><p>
<h1><a name="X-section">X</a></h1>


<p><b><a name="xor">XOR</a></b> &nbsp; &nbsp;
The exclusive-or <a href="glossary-F.html#function">function</a>; given two <a href="glossary-B.html#boolean">Boolean</a> inputs, the
output of XOR is 1 if and only if the two inputs are different;
otherwise, the output is 0.  



