<p><hr align=left size=1 noshade width="100%"><p>
<h1><a name="Z-section">Z</a></h1>


<p><b><a name="zero-sum_game">Zero-Sum Game</a></b> &nbsp; &nbsp;
In <a href="glossary-G.html#game_theory">game theory</a>, a game in which a win for one player results in
an equal but opposite loss for the other players.  


